  "decision_conditions": [
    "The proposed crossover, by reason of its excessive width and insufficient forecourt depth, would result in vehicles overhanging the public footway and the loss of on-street parking, leading to conditions prejudicial to pedestrian and highway safety and increasing parking stress. The proposal is therefore contrary to Policies DMD 46 and Appendix 8 of the Development Management Document (2014), the Council's Vehicle Crossover Guidance Notes, and the guidance set out in the National Planning Policy Framework (2024)."
